  ],
  "duration_s": 394.970998,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九七四年二月六日深夜，北京医院里一位八十四岁的老人已经虚弱的说不出话来，他颤抖着用手指在床头柜上比划，护士赶紧递上纸笔，老人用尽最后一丝力气歪歪扭扭，写下一行字。今天最高气温零下一度，最低气温零下七度，东风一至二级。晴转多云。写完，他放下往下笔闭上了眼睛。第二天，他走了，这是他留在人间的最后一行天气记录。而这样的记录，他整整写了三十八年，将近一万四千多天，一天都没断过。他叫朱可臻，中国近代气象学的奠基人。可今天十个人里能有一个说出他名字的就不错了。故事得从他十六岁那年说起。那一年，朱可臻在上海念书，有人当着他的面嘲笑中国人，你们连自己的风雨都测，不准拿什么跟洋人比？这句话像根刺扎进了少年心里。那时候的中国是什么样子？偌大一个国家，连一张自己的天气图都画不出来，东北的气象掌握在日本人手里，上海、香港的观测点被洋人把持着，连台风来了都得等别国通报。一个国家的气象命脉，攥在别人手里。那跟把家门钥匙交给外人有什么区别？二十岁那年，朱可臻考取公费留学后，进入了哈佛大学别的学生选热门专业，他偏偏选了气象学一个当时全中国几乎没人听说过的东西。同学问他，为啥，他只说了一句，中国的天空不能永远让别人管着。一九一八年博士学位刚拿到手，他一天都没多待，转头就回了国。可下了船，他愣住了，泱泱大国，四万万同胞居然没有一座自己的气象台。外国人在中国的土地上架着仪器，测着中国的风云数据。锁在人家保险柜里，中国人想看一眼，还得低头去。要从那一天起，朱可珍口袋里多了一只温度计。他走到哪儿寄到哪儿，候车室船上防空洞里，别人聊天说话。他掏出小本子写两笔，朋友都觉得这人魔怔啊，可就是这个魔怔的人。在南京高等师范学校一首建起了中国第一个气象学系。先给咱们自己培养人才。从一九二零年到一九三零年，整整十年，他带着人翻山越岭，从拉萨到峨眉山，从泰山到内陆，平原风餐露宿，一步一个脚印建起了四十多个气象站一百多个雨量观测点。一九二八年，他在南京北极阁建起了中国第一个由中国人自己掌管的气象研究所。一九三零年的元旦，天刚蒙蒙亮，朱可贞站在电报机前，手里攥着一沓，刚从全国各地传回的数据，他深吸一口气，在预报单上写下六个字，全国天气预报这六个字，中国人等了几十年。从这一天起，我们的阴晴雨雪终于不再有洋人说了算。你以为这就完了？没有没过几年，抗战爆发，南京告急研究所要撤退，别人收拾金银细软朱可珍呢。他把二十七箱气象仪器打包装箱温度仪湿度计，气压表一件都不能丢人。对学生们说，这些仪器就是我们手里的枪人。在仪器在一九三七年冬天，他们撤到武汉。日本的飞机在头顶盘旋，炸弹就在几百米外炸开，整座城都在摇晃，可朱可臻蹲在简陋的临时气象站里，一手扶着温度计，一手在本子上记数据。有人冲着他喊，朱先生快跑啊，他头也不抬。再等等，这个时间点的数据不能断。就是在那样的日子里，中国气象人的研究一天都没有停。哎，炮火连天中，他们还在分析梅与规律研究季风走向。这些数据后来被盟军用于飞行作战，救了不知多少人的命。抗战胜利后，朱可臻带着完好无损的二十七箱仪器回到南京。有人问他是怎么做到的？他笑着说，我是用命换故事，讲到这儿，你可能以为朱可臻就是个搞气象的错了。他不光搞气象，是一把好手办教育，他也是民国四大校长之一。一九三六年，他接掌浙大的时候，学校经费紧缺，人心涣散。校长换了一茬又一茬，他上任之后干了什么？在逃难路上，他失去了儿子，又失去了妻子，却把一所烂校办成了中国顶尖。他到底是怎么做到的？下集告诉你，看到这儿先别划走，点个赞，是对这位看了一辈子天的老人的敬意。收藏起来讲，给你的孩子听，你今天打开手机能看天气预报，是有人拿命换来的，转发给更多人，让朱可贞这个名字被更多人记住。关注我，夏季更狠，儿子死了，妻子死了，他带着学校走了两千六百多公里。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 2490,
      "text": "一九七四年二月六日深夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3070,
      "end_ms": 8590,
      "text": "北京医院里一位八十四岁的老人已经虚弱的说不出话来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00003",
      "start_ms": 9430,
      "end_ms": 13450,
      "text": "他颤抖着用手指在床头柜上比划，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00004",
      "start_ms": 13850,
      "end_ms": 15530,
      "text": "护士赶紧递上纸笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15950,
      "end_ms": 19370,
      "text": "老人用尽最后一丝力气歪歪扭扭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00006",
      "start_ms": 19370,
      "end_ms": 20390,
      "text": "写下一行字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20950,
      "end_ms": 23130,
      "text": "今天最高气温零下一度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23470,
      "end_ms": 25170,
      "text": "最低气温零下七度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25510,
      "end_ms": 26910,
      "text": "东风一至二级。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27390,
      "end_ms": 28410,
      "text": "晴转多云。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28810,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "写完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00012",
      "start_ms": 29530,
      "end_ms": 31720,
      "text": "他放下往下笔闭上了眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32160,
      "end_ms": 32800,
      "text": "第二天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00014",
      "start_ms": 33060,
      "end_ms": 33760,
      "text": "他走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34180,
      "end_ms": 37640,
      "text": "这是他留在人间的最后一行天气记录。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00016",
      "start_ms": 37760,
      "end_ms": 38960,
      "text": "而这样的记录，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39200,
      "end_ms": 41540,
      "text": "他整整写了三十八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00018",
      "start_ms": 42060,
      "end_ms": 44060,
      "text": "将近一万四千多天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00019",
      "start_ms": 44900,
      "end_ms": 46260,
      "text": "一天都没断过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00020",
      "start_ms": 47040,
      "end_ms": 48000,
      "text": "他叫朱可臻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00021",
      "start_ms": 48400,
      "end_ms": 50880,
      "text": "中国近代气象学的奠基人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00022",
      "start_ms": 52080,
      "end_ms": 57160,
      "text": "可今天十个人里能有一个说出他名字的就不错了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00023",
      "start_ms": 58000,
      "end_ms": 60645,
      "text": "故事得从他十六岁那年说起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61170,
      "end_ms": 61750,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00025",
      "start_ms": 61990,
      "end_ms": 63785,
      "text": "朱可臻在上海念书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00026",
      "start_ms": 64220,
      "end_ms": 66625,
      "text": "有人当着他的面嘲笑中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00027",
      "start_ms": 66980,
      "end_ms": 68500,
      "text": "你们连自己的风雨都测，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00028",
      "start_ms": 68500,
      "end_ms": 70675,
      "text": "不准拿什么跟洋人比？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00029",
      "start_ms": 70920,
      "end_ms": 74225,
      "text": "这句话像根刺扎进了少年心里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00030",
      "start_ms": 74450,
      "end_ms": 76105,
      "text": "那时候的中国是什么样子？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00031",
      "start_ms": 76570,
      "end_ms": 77670,
      "text": "偌大一个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00032",
      "start_ms": 77850,
      "end_ms": 81045,
      "text": "连一张自己的天气图都画不出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81720,
      "end_ms": 84415,
      "text": "东北的气象掌握在日本人手里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00034",
      "start_ms": 84860,
      "end_ms": 88715,
      "text": "上海、香港的观测点被洋人把持着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00035",
      "start_ms": 89110,
      "end_ms": 92165,
      "text": "连台风来了都得等别国通报。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00036",
      "start_ms": 92590,
      "end_ms": 94430,
      "text": "一个国家的气象命脉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00037",
      "start_ms": 94630,
      "end_ms": 95905,
      "text": "攥在别人手里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00038",
      "start_ms": 96580,
      "end_ms": 99925,
      "text": "那跟把家门钥匙交给外人有什么区别？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00039",
      "start_ms": 100440,
      "end_ms": 101565,
      "text": "二十岁那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00040",
      "start_ms": 102120,
      "end_ms": 104560,
      "text": "朱可臻考取公费留学后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00041",
      "start_ms": 104920,
      "end_ms": 108685,
      "text": "进入了哈佛大学别的学生选热门专业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00042",
      "start_ms": 109020,
      "end_ms": 114785,
      "text": "他偏偏选了气象学一个当时全中国几乎没人听说过的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00043",
      "start_ms": 115720,
      "end_ms": 116420,
      "text": "同学问他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00044",
      "start_ms": 116420,
      "end_ms": 116915,
      "text": "为啥，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00045",
      "start_ms": 117760,
      "end_ms": 118945,
      "text": "他只说了一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00046",
      "start_ms": 119400,
      "end_ms": 123485,
      "text": "中国的天空不能永远让别人管着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00047",
      "start_ms": 125440,
      "end_ms": 128250,
      "text": "一九一八年博士学位刚拿到手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00048",
      "start_ms": 128430,
      "end_ms": 129790,
      "text": "他一天都没多待，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00049",
      "start_ms": 130010,
      "end_ms": 131295,
      "text": "转头就回了国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00050",
      "start_ms": 131890,
      "end_ms": 132670,
      "text": "可下了船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00051",
      "start_ms": 132930,
      "end_ms": 133795,
      "text": "他愣住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00052",
      "start_ms": 134120,
      "end_ms": 135180,
      "text": "泱泱大国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00053",
      "start_ms": 135600,
      "end_ms": 139715,
      "text": "四万万同胞居然没有一座自己的气象台。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00054",
      "start_ms": 140290,
      "end_ms": 143050,
      "text": "外国人在中国的土地上架着仪器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00055",
      "start_ms": 143350,
      "end_ms": 145920,
      "text": "测着中国的风云数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00056",
      "start_ms": 145920,
      "end_ms": 147340,
      "text": "锁在人家保险柜里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00057",
      "start_ms": 147340,
      "end_ms": 148460,
      "text": "中国人想看一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00058",
      "start_ms": 148460,
      "end_ms": 149200,
      "text": "还得低头去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00059",
      "start_ms": 149200,
      "end_ms": 151495,
      "text": "要从那一天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00060",
      "start_ms": 152200,
      "end_ms": 154425,
      "text": "朱可珍口袋里多了一只温度计。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00061",
      "start_ms": 155400,
      "end_ms": 156625,
      "text": "他走到哪儿寄到哪儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00062",
      "start_ms": 157640,
      "end_ms": 161985,
      "text": "候车室船上防空洞里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00063",
      "start_ms": 162470,
      "end_ms": 163955,
      "text": "别人聊天说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00064",
      "start_ms": 164340,
      "end_ms": 166165,
      "text": "他掏出小本子写两笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00065",
      "start_ms": 167000,
      "end_ms": 169095,
      "text": "朋友都觉得这人魔怔啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00066",
      "start_ms": 169980,
      "end_ms": 171625,
      "text": "可就是这个魔怔的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00067",
      "start_ms": 172010,
      "end_ms": 177705,
      "text": "在南京高等师范学校一首建起了中国第一个气象学系。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00068",
      "start_ms": 178300,
      "end_ms": 180335,
      "text": "先给咱们自己培养人才。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00069",
      "start_ms": 181210,
      "end_ms": 184435,
      "text": "从一九二零年到一九三零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00070",
      "start_ms": 184750,
      "end_ms": 185770,
      "text": "整整十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00071",
      "start_ms": 185850,
      "end_ms": 187465,
      "text": "他带着人翻山越岭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00072",
      "start_ms": 188080,
      "end_ms": 189895,
      "text": "从拉萨到峨眉山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00073",
      "start_ms": 190160,
      "end_ms": 191800,
      "text": "从泰山到内陆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00074",
      "start_ms": 191800,
      "end_ms": 194235,
      "text": "平原风餐露宿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00075",
      "start_ms": 194620,
      "end_ms": 201185,
      "text": "一步一个脚印建起了四十多个气象站一百多个雨量观测点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00076",
      "start_ms": 201820,
      "end_ms": 202800,
      "text": "一九二八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00077",
      "start_ms": 202940,
      "end_ms": 209664,
      "text": "他在南京北极阁建起了中国第一个由中国人自己掌管的气象研究所。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00078",
      "start_ms": 210610,
      "end_ms": 212225,
      "text": "一九三零年的元旦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00079",
      "start_ms": 213310,
      "end_ms": 214535,
      "text": "天刚蒙蒙亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00080",
      "start_ms": 215390,
      "end_ms": 217245,
      "text": "朱可贞站在电报机前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00081",
      "start_ms": 217720,
      "end_ms": 219000,
      "text": "手里攥着一沓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00082",
      "start_ms": 219000,
      "end_ms": 221735,
      "text": "刚从全国各地传回的数据，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00083",
      "start_ms": 222210,
      "end_ms": 223430,
      "text": "他深吸一口气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00084",
      "start_ms": 223510,
      "end_ms": 225305,
      "text": "在预报单上写下六个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00085",
      "start_ms": 225650,
      "end_ms": 228600,
      "text": "全国天气预报这六个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00086",
      "start_ms": 228840,
      "end_ms": 230385,
      "text": "中国人等了几十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00087",
      "start_ms": 231220,
      "end_ms": 232265,
      "text": "从这一天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00088",
      "start_ms": 232830,
      "end_ms": 237465,
      "text": "我们的阴晴雨雪终于不再有洋人说了算。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00089",
      "start_ms": 237920,
      "end_ms": 239135,
      "text": "你以为这就完了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00090",
      "start_ms": 240660,
      "end_ms": 242320,
      "text": "没有没过几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00091",
      "start_ms": 242560,
      "end_ms": 243460,
      "text": "抗战爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00092",
      "start_ms": 243700,
      "end_ms": 246160,
      "text": "南京告急研究所要撤退，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00093",
      "start_ms": 246960,
      "end_ms": 250280,
      "text": "别人收拾金银细软朱可珍呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00094",
      "start_ms": 250400,
      "end_ms": 256440,
      "text": "他把二十七箱气象仪器打包装箱温度仪湿度计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00095",
      "start_ms": 256620,
      "end_ms": 259860,
      "text": "气压表一件都不能丢人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00096",
      "start_ms": 259860,
      "end_ms": 260640,
      "text": "对学生们说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00097",
      "start_ms": 260780,
      "end_ms": 264740,
      "text": "这些仪器就是我们手里的枪人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00098",
      "start_ms": 264760,
      "end_ms": 268120,
      "text": "在仪器在一九三七年冬天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00099",
      "start_ms": 268320,
      "end_ms": 269825,
      "text": "他们撤到武汉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00100",
      "start_ms": 270450,
      "end_ms": 272510,
      "text": "日本的飞机在头顶盘旋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00101",
      "start_ms": 272910,
      "end_ms": 274970,
      "text": "炸弹就在几百米外炸开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00102",
      "start_ms": 275470,
      "end_ms": 277310,
      "text": "整座城都在摇晃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00103",
      "start_ms": 277870,
      "end_ms": 281130,
      "text": "可朱可臻蹲在简陋的临时气象站里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00104",
      "start_ms": 281610,
      "end_ms": 283170,
      "text": "一手扶着温度计，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00105",
      "start_ms": 283410,
      "end_ms": 285270,
      "text": "一手在本子上记数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00106",
      "start_ms": 285790,
      "end_ms": 286930,
      "text": "有人冲着他喊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00107",
      "start_ms": 287410,
      "end_ms": 289270,
      "text": "朱先生快跑啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00108",
      "start_ms": 290490,
      "end_ms": 291430,
      "text": "他头也不抬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00109",
      "start_ms": 291610,
      "end_ms": 292210,
      "text": "再等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00110",
      "start_ms": 293430,
      "end_ms": 295490,
      "text": "这个时间点的数据不能断。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00111",
      "start_ms": 295950,
      "end_ms": 297410,
      "text": "就是在那样的日子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00112",
      "start_ms": 297410,
      "end_ms": 300315,
      "text": "中国气象人的研究一天都没有停。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00113",
      "start_ms": 300400,
      "end_ms": 300655,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00114",
      "start_ms": 301300,
      "end_ms": 302640,
      "text": "炮火连天中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00115",
      "start_ms": 302900,
      "end_ms": 306845,
      "text": "他们还在分析梅与规律研究季风走向。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00116",
      "start_ms": 307510,
      "end_ms": 310490,
      "text": "这些数据后来被盟军用于飞行作战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00117",
      "start_ms": 311030,
      "end_ms": 312590,
      "text": "救了不知多少人的命。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00118",
      "start_ms": 313190,
      "end_ms": 314370,
      "text": "抗战胜利后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00119",
      "start_ms": 314690,
      "end_ms": 320310,
      "text": "朱可臻带着完好无损的二十七箱仪器回到南京。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00120",
      "start_ms": 321150,
      "end_ms": 322810,
      "text": "有人问他是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00121",
      "start_ms": 322930,
      "end_ms": 323770,
      "text": "他笑着说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00122",
      "start_ms": 324350,
      "end_ms": 327270,
      "text": "我是用命换故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00123",
      "start_ms": 327270,
      "end_ms": 328090,
      "text": "讲到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00124",
      "start_ms": 328450,
      "end_ms": 332870,
      "text": "你可能以为朱可臻就是个搞气象的错了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00125",
      "start_ms": 333470,
      "end_ms": 334910,
      "text": "他不光搞气象，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00126",
      "start_ms": 335110,
      "end_ms": 336915,
      "text": "是一把好手办教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00127",
      "start_ms": 337180,
      "end_ms": 339360,
      "text": "他也是民国四大校长之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00128",
      "start_ms": 339820,
      "end_ms": 340980,
      "text": "一九三六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00129",
      "start_ms": 341000,
      "end_ms": 342780,
      "text": "他接掌浙大的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00130",
      "start_ms": 343160,
      "end_ms": 344800,
      "text": "学校经费紧缺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00131",
      "start_ms": 345299,
      "end_ms": 346420,
      "text": "人心涣散。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00132",
      "start_ms": 347020,
      "end_ms": 348880,
      "text": "校长换了一茬又一茬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00133",
      "start_ms": 349360,
      "end_ms": 351080,
      "text": "他上任之后干了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00134",
      "start_ms": 351500,
      "end_ms": 352640,
      "text": "在逃难路上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00135",
      "start_ms": 353080,
      "end_ms": 354320,
      "text": "他失去了儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00136",
      "start_ms": 354460,
      "end_ms": 355760,
      "text": "又失去了妻子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00137",
      "start_ms": 356140,
      "end_ms": 359460,
      "text": "却把一所烂校办成了中国顶尖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00138",
      "start_ms": 360420,
      "end_ms": 362220,
      "text": "他到底是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00139",
      "start_ms": 362280,
      "end_ms": 363140,
      "text": "下集告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00140",
      "start_ms": 363140,
      "end_ms": 366925,
      "text": "看到这儿先别划走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00141",
      "start_ms": 368090,
      "end_ms": 368735,
      "text": "点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00142",
      "start_ms": 369660,
      "end_ms": 373384,
      "text": "是对这位看了一辈子天的老人的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00143",
      "start_ms": 373800,
      "end_ms": 374940,
      "text": "收藏起来讲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00144",
      "start_ms": 374960,
      "end_ms": 376055,
      "text": "给你的孩子听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00145",
      "start_ms": 376460,
      "end_ms": 379015,
      "text": "你今天打开手机能看天气预报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00146",
      "start_ms": 379380,
      "end_ms": 380905,
      "text": "是有人拿命换来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00147",
      "start_ms": 381400,
      "end_ms": 382835,
      "text": "转发给更多人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00148",
      "start_ms": 383340,
      "end_ms": 386385,
      "text": "让朱可贞这个名字被更多人记住。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00149",
      "start_ms": 387010,
      "end_ms": 387655,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00150",
      "start_ms": 388010,
      "end_ms": 388865,
      "text": "夏季更狠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00151",
      "start_ms": 389510,
      "end_ms": 390310,
      "text": "儿子死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00152",
      "start_ms": 390310,
      "end_ms": 391215,
      "text": "妻子死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7967c21e0878bcb8_s00153",
      "start_ms": 391480,
      "end_ms": 394875,
      "text": "他带着学校走了两千六百多公里。"
    }
  ],
